WEBVTT

00:01:59.365 --> 00:02:02.618
they will tell you because they want
to watch the best of the best.

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:04.620
Anything else ...

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:07.373
isn't worth their time.

00:02:08.207 --> 00:02:09.625
This reasoning ...

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:14.172
it presents itself as biological.

00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:18.426
The men’s sprint champion --

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:21.345
always a half-second faster
than the women's sprint champion.

00:02:22.013 --> 00:02:23.890
The men of the NBA --

00:02:23.931 --> 00:02:28.227
most of them can jump higher
than the women of the WNBA,

00:02:28.269 --> 00:02:29.687
and on, and on ...